(4575289, 658755, 88010, '<td valign="top">What I see: a nice scenic of horses on a hill surrounded by trees with a little bitty fence in the foreground. I was taught early on to look at the picture and talk about it, and then know what the picture is all about. So to me this photo doesn''t say "fence", it says "scenic with horses on a hill surrounded by tree''s and litle fence in the foreground".<br/>Hope that helps.</td>', 'What I see: a nice scenic of horses on a hill surrounded by trees with a little bitty fence in the foreground. I was taught early on to look at the picture and talk about it, and then know what the picture is all about. So to me this photo doesn''t say "fence", it says "scenic with horses on a hill surrounded by tree''s and litle fence in the foreground".Hope that helps.', '2008-03-19 19:59:38.000000', NULL, 1),
