(4575305, 659400, 88010, '<td valign="top">If you saw this hanging on a wall how would you explain it to a person over the phone that cannot see it. <br/>I see a field of gold that takes up the majority of the photo and at the top right , taking up about 1/10 of the frame is what appears to be a tall blak fence, but it could be shorter as I have no way of really telling, and the top left, taking up a higher  portion is gray sky. <br/> <br/>So this pic is about a field, not a fence.</td>', 'If you saw this hanging on a wall how would you explain it to a person over the phone that cannot see it. I see a field of gold that takes up the majority of the photo and at the top right , taking up about 1/10 of the frame is what appears to be a tall blak fence, but it could be shorter as I have no way of really telling, and the top left, taking up a higher  portion is gray sky.  So this pic is about a field, not a fence.', '2008-03-19 20:05:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4575308, 658484, 88010, '<td valign="top">For a stronger composition I would crop out the entire sky area, it''s not needed and adds nothing to the story of the old fence. The story of the old fence is all about it'' being overgrown. I would close in on that.</td>', 'For a stronger composition I would crop out the entire sky area, it''s not needed and adds nothing to the story of the old fence. The story of the old fence is all about it'' being overgrown. I would close in on that.', '2008-03-19 20:06:57.000000', NULL, 1),
