(4576400, 657785, 80458, '<td valign="top">It''s a beautiful shot. I really enjoy the lighting and the mood. I think it''s slightly a stretch with the fence theme, but I''m still rating it well.</td>', 'It''s a beautiful shot. I really enjoy the lighting and the mood. I think it''s slightly a stretch with the fence theme, but I''m still rating it well.', '2008-03-20 10:00:32.000000', NULL, 1),
