(4576730, 658601, 30861, '<td valign="top">This looks like it could be at Cape Cod. Except the fence is neater than ours :-) Very cool shot, love the ship. If my experience with similar shots is worth anything, you''re getting nailed by the noise police, right? Don''t let ''em get you down; it works here.</td>', 'This looks like it could be at Cape Cod. Except the fence is neater than ours :-) Very cool shot, love the ship. If my experience with similar shots is worth anything, you''re getting nailed by the noise police, right? Don''t let ''em get you down; it works here.', '2008-03-20 12:34:34.000000', NULL, 1),
