(4577646, 659308, 32011, '<td valign="top">... will make you JUMP JUMP... daddy mac will make you JUMP JUMP...<br/> <br/>sorry... couldn''t help myself when I read the title  :)<br/> <br/>Interesting photo...  I like the angle and the balance of the image, however, IMO, it might have been a better image if the focus was on the area closes to the camera rather than off in the distance.  There''s nothing there of particular significance (relative to the rest of the image) and you don''t really get to see the detail in the wood that you would have had you focused on the part closest to the camera.</td>', '... will make you JUMP JUMP... daddy mac will make you JUMP JUMP... sorry... couldn''t help myself when I read the title  :) Interesting photo...  I like the angle and the balance of the image, however, IMO, it might have been a better image if the focus was on the area closes to the camera rather than off in the distance.  There''s nothing there of particular significance (relative to the rest of the image) and you don''t really get to see the detail in the wood that you would have had you focused on the part closest to the camera.', '2008-03-20 19:51:14.000000', NULL, 1),
