(4578844, 659116, 89333, '<td valign="top">Nice image, but it needs to be cropped from the top as there is far too much white sky. It would have been better to wait for a blue sky (or dramatic clouds), but I realize that may not have been possible. I would also crop from the left close to the fence to focus the image there.</td>', 'Nice image, but it needs to be cropped from the top as there is far too much white sky. It would have been better to wait for a blue sky (or dramatic clouds), but I realize that may not have been possible. I would also crop from the left close to the fence to focus the image there.', '2008-03-21 14:18:05.000000', NULL, 1),
