(4578874, 658180, 90777, '<td valign="top">I think this was a slower than average shutter speed as a result the image is suffering from camera (person) shake.  If possible, open your aperture or increase the ISO rating to allow faster shutter speeds.  Otherwise a great concept, and the sad looking monkey really adds to your title.</td>', 'I think this was a slower than average shutter speed as a result the image is suffering from camera (person) shake.  If possible, open your aperture or increase the ISO rating to allow faster shutter speeds.  Otherwise a great concept, and the sad looking monkey really adds to your title.', '2008-03-21 14:27:08.000000', NULL, 1),
