(4579244, 658346, 66597, '<td valign="top">I love this until I get to the sky, which is an odd shade and makes the whole photo look like the reds were turned up too much.</td>', 'I love this until I get to the sky, which is an odd shade and makes the whole photo look like the reds were turned up too much.', '2008-03-21 19:22:16.000000', NULL, 1),
