(4579480, 658672, 83313, '<td valign="top">Nice perspective. I like perspectives. This leads my eye quite nicely.</td>', 'Nice perspective. I like perspectives. This leads my eye quite nicely.', '2008-03-21 23:47:17.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579543, 658346, 90394, '<td valign="top">Great location and subject, and the fence really stands out here, regardless of the trees and the road/walkway. Great composition, levels and color.<br/> <br/>Oversharpening hurts this, however. It gives it an almost "granular" effect, like the image was made from colored, perfectly placed sand particles.<br/> <br/>I love this image, but that <i>one glaring technical</i> hurts a bit...</td>', 'Great location and subject, and the fence really stands out here, regardless of the trees and the road/walkway. Great composition, levels and color. Oversharpening hurts this, however. It gives it an almost "granular" effect, like the image was made from colored, perfectly placed sand particles. I love this image, but that one glaring technical hurts a bit...', '2008-03-22 01:00:07.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579556, 659239, 73056, '<td valign="top">Great silhouette. Looks like a ribbon to me.</td>', 'Great silhouette. Looks like a ribbon to me.', '2008-03-22 01:22:06.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579557, 659066, 73056, '<td valign="top">I really like this shot! Love the crop, clarity, simplicity and border. Nicely executed and presented!</td>', 'I really like this shot! Love the crop, clarity, simplicity and border. Nicely executed and presented!', '2008-03-22 01:22:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579563, 658950, 90394, '<td valign="top">I don''t know how much you worked the <i>saturation</i> slider on this one, if at all, but you made it look incredibly natural, unlike many <i>garrish oversaturations</i> in these challenges. I applaud you for that, and a fantastic composition!! This is getting a high one from me...</td>', 'I don''t know how much you worked the saturation slider on this one, if at all, but you made it look incredibly natural, unlike many garrish oversaturations in these challenges. I applaud you for that, and a fantastic composition!! This is getting a high one from me...', '2008-03-22 01:31:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579565, 659320, 90394, '<td valign="top">Hmmm... too much contrast here. The blacks too black, and the whites too white, which has cost you some detail, and perhaps some texture. The fence isn''t of enough stature here, either. That <i>is</i> a fence in the middle, too, right?<br/> <br/>Composition seems okay, but this is gonna be a tough sell in this challenge...</td>', 'Hmmm... too much contrast here. The blacks too black, and the whites too white, which has cost you some detail, and perhaps some texture. The fence isn''t of enough stature here, either. That is a fence in the middle, too, right? Composition seems okay, but this is gonna be a tough sell in this challenge...', '2008-03-22 01:35:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579567, 658707, 90394, '<td valign="top">A bit over saturated, and looks slightly unnatural. Other technicals are okay, and it fits the theme very well. The contrast between the background and foreground colors is striking...</td>', 'A bit over saturated, and looks slightly unnatural. Other technicals are okay, and it fits the theme very well. The contrast between the background and foreground colors is striking...', '2008-03-22 01:38:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579582, 658680, 90394, '<td valign="top">My interpretation here is this: you have chainlinks, but no visible fence. These can be used for storage cages, various animal cages, and baseball back-stops. I was looking for actual fences, and this may be one, but it''s not readily apparent. It''s chainlinks.<br/> <br/>Some sky, or other background would have sold me <i>just enough,</i> but that red implies it''s standing/lying against something else... but no shadows. Did you slide the red sat''ch up on this?<br/> <br/>Overall, an okay photo, and the technicals are passable, if a bit noisey.</td>', 'My interpretation here is this: you have chainlinks, but no visible fence. These can be used for storage cages, various animal cages, and baseball back-stops. I was looking for actual fences, and this may be one, but it''s not readily apparent. It''s chainlinks. Some sky, or other background would have sold me just enough, but that red implies it''s standing/lying against something else... but no shadows. Did you slide the red sat''ch up on this? Overall, an okay photo, and the technicals are passable, if a bit noisey.', '2008-03-22 01:53:46.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579585, 658358, 90394, '<td valign="top">Good DOF, nice natural color (which I like!) and very good composition - overall, a very good entry!!</td>', 'Good DOF, nice natural color (which I like!) and very good composition - overall, a very good entry!!', '2008-03-22 01:54:56.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579588, 657754, 90394, '<td valign="top">Nice lines, great comp, and more natural colors!!! (Yay!!!) A <i>very</i> nice balance of contrast and overall imagery. Very nice, I like this alot for this challenge.<br/> <br/>Time of day may have helped, too. I can see how too much sun might be too much for an image like this, with the white fence and all.</td>', 'Nice lines, great comp, and more natural colors!!! (Yay!!!) A very nice balance of contrast and overall imagery. Very nice, I like this alot for this challenge. Time of day may have helped, too. I can see how too much sun might be too much for an image like this, with the white fence and all.', '2008-03-22 01:57:49.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579596, 657962, 90394, '<td valign="top">Bland... gritty... gungy... and I like it!!! Good entry, and a nice view of a not-so-nice looking subject. The dead grass, the rust, the dead tree, the freshly painted wheel and fire escape adding a touch of color to an otherwise blunt scene... makes me wonder what''s in the water...<br/> <br/>I''d have tinkered with the contrast or tone curve a bit, to darken it slightly, but that doesn''t hurt much here. Very good!</td>', 'Bland... gritty... gungy... and I like it!!! Good entry, and a nice view of a not-so-nice looking subject. The dead grass, the rust, the dead tree, the freshly painted wheel and fire escape adding a touch of color to an otherwise blunt scene... makes me wonder what''s in the water... I''d have tinkered with the contrast or tone curve a bit, to darken it slightly, but that doesn''t hurt much here. Very good!', '2008-03-22 02:02:52.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579614, 659193, 90394, '<td valign="top">A bit of a shoehorn here, since those <i>roll gaurds</i> don''t qualify as a true fence.</td>', 'A bit of a shoehorn here, since those roll gaurds don''t qualify as a true fence.', '2008-03-22 02:47:43.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579615, 659331, 90394, '<td valign="top">Beautiful! Great comp and technicals, natural colors - very nice!</td>', 'Beautiful! Great comp and technicals, natural colors - very nice!', '2008-03-22 02:49:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579626, 659651, 90394, '<td valign="top">An excellent image, and perfectly composed. My preference is for more natural color, and the left-lower side is a tad dark, but you did this tastefully. Very nice!</td>', 'An excellent image, and perfectly composed. My preference is for more natural color, and the left-lower side is a tad dark, but you did this tastefully. Very nice!', '2008-03-22 03:16:45.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579628, 659505, 90394, '<td valign="top">You must really have been tempted to sharpen this up - that little slider was calling your name, right? LOL. I''m glad you didn''t. It preserves your DOF better this way, more gradual, making this look more professional. A beautifully balanced comp - excellent!!!</td>', 'You must really have been tempted to sharpen this up - that little slider was calling your name, right? LOL. I''m glad you didn''t. It preserves your DOF better this way, more gradual, making this look more professional. A beautifully balanced comp - excellent!!!', '2008-03-22 03:18:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579629, 659228, 90394, '<td valign="top">A fine phot, if a bit "snap-shotty", but you have alot-o-fences here, and picked a good subject. Could be a tad overexposed in the white parts, but an otherwise good shot.</td>', 'A fine phot, if a bit "snap-shotty", but you have alot-o-fences here, and picked a good subject. Could be a tad overexposed in the white parts, but an otherwise good shot.', '2008-03-22 03:21:09.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579631, 659169, 90394, '<td valign="top">Laser sharp, good colors and comp, but perhaps a bit overexposed on the fence - that lighting is a tad harsh, and limits the texture and detail a smidge. Otherwise, a very good subject, and a fine submission.</td>', 'Laser sharp, good colors and comp, but perhaps a bit overexposed on the fence - that lighting is a tad harsh, and limits the texture and detail a smidge. Otherwise, a very good subject, and a fine submission.', '2008-03-22 03:22:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579632, 658028, 90394, '<td valign="top">A bit too bright on the sunlit parts, but otherwise very nice! Well composed as well, I really have a feel for the magnitude of the clouds, and flat landscape here... excelllent!</td>', 'A bit too bright on the sunlit parts, but otherwise very nice! Well composed as well, I really have a feel for the magnitude of the clouds, and flat landscape here... excelllent!', '2008-03-22 03:24:34.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579637, 657772, 90394, '<td valign="top">Oh my. That''s quite a predicament, and one of the most original in this challenge! Great comp/colors/levels and scenery. Nuff said.</td>', 'Oh my. That''s quite a predicament, and one of the most original in this challenge! Great comp/colors/levels and scenery. Nuff said.', '2008-03-22 03:30:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579639, 658966, 90394, '<td valign="top">One of the few close ups I''ve truly enjoyed. Great comp/levels/colors and subject, and have fun storming the castle! Errr... Cathedral? You see, a pic like this inspires the imagination to a yank like me, who rarely sees such ornamentation in fine fencery... y-e-a-h... Very nice!</td>', 'One of the few close ups I''ve truly enjoyed. Great comp/levels/colors and subject, and have fun storming the castle! Errr... Cathedral? You see, a pic like this inspires the imagination to a yank like me, who rarely sees such ornamentation in fine fencery... y-e-a-h... Very nice!', '2008-03-22 03:33:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579642, 659195, 90394, '<td valign="top">This looks a bit dark to me, but I won''t ding you for it. I like the scenery, the composition and overall color, and that fire-plug adds to it, ''tho I''m thinking you may have wished it weren''t there? I hope not, it''s interesting to look at, because of it''s sad condition - despite someone''s obvious attempt to paint it to look nice. Weathered and overgrown - I dunno, I just like it.</td>', 'This looks a bit dark to me, but I won''t ding you for it. I like the scenery, the composition and overall color, and that fire-plug adds to it, ''tho I''m thinking you may have wished it weren''t there? I hope not, it''s interesting to look at, because of it''s sad condition - despite someone''s obvious attempt to paint it to look nice. Weathered and overgrown - I dunno, I just like it.', '2008-03-22 03:37:20.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579646, 658272, 47541, '<td valign="top">Ohhh, <img alt="'' . substr(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', strrpos(''//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif'', ''/'') + 1) . ''" border="0" src="//www.dpchallenge.com/images/user_icon/21.gif"/> <a href="//www.dpchallenge.com/profile.php?USER_ID=40718" rel="nofollow" target="_blank">DrAchoo</a> is gonna sue you if he finds out you''ve got this shot ;)<br/> <br/>Seriously though, nice macro<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-03-27 21:38:20.</i></td>', 'Ohhh,  DrAchoo is gonna sue you if he finds out you''ve got this shot ;) Seriously though, nice macro', '2008-03-22 03:39:00.000000', '2008-03-27 21:38:20.000000', 1),
(4579647, 659680, 90394, '<td valign="top">You have a fine comp, and scene - but the image looks oversharpened, when it should really have benefitted from a softer look. Colrs look a bit garrish, and unnatural, and somewhat overexposed.</td>', 'You have a fine comp, and scene - but the image looks oversharpened, when it should really have benefitted from a softer look. Colrs look a bit garrish, and unnatural, and somewhat overexposed.', '2008-03-22 03:41:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579649, 658060, 90394, '<td valign="top">Looks to be shot through some sort of filter, and this is way too unnatural looking to me. Reverse those two comments, and this would be a fine comp with great scenery, it''s just hard to get past those intense reds, and golds...</td>', 'Looks to be shot through some sort of filter, and this is way too unnatural looking to me. Reverse those two comments, and this would be a fine comp with great scenery, it''s just hard to get past those intense reds, and golds...', '2008-03-22 03:43:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579650, 657227, 90394, '<td valign="top">I think you just burned my retinas out... This is a good composition, but too overexposed, which costs texture, and some detail.</td>', 'I think you just burned my retinas out... This is a good composition, but too overexposed, which costs texture, and some detail.', '2008-03-22 03:44:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579652, 659145, 90394, '<td valign="top">Slight over-saturation aside, this is a beautiful comp and scene. More natural looking would be a bonus here, but this is hard to complain about. Very nice!!</td>', 'Slight over-saturation aside, this is a beautiful comp and scene. More natural looking would be a bonus here, but this is hard to complain about. Very nice!!', '2008-03-22 03:45:54.000000', NULL, 1),
(4579655, 659672, 90394, '<td valign="top">You really have great scenery, and a fine composition here, but it''s oversaturated, and would benefit from a more natural look. That blue up top wouldn''t have been so distracting otherwise... but this is still a fine photo.</td>', 'You really have great scenery, and a fine composition here, but it''s oversaturated, and would benefit from a more natural look. That blue up top wouldn''t have been so distracting otherwise... but this is still a fine photo.', '2008-03-22 03:48:59.000000', NULL, 1),
