(4579659, 659241, 90394, '<td valign="top">Nice comp, scenery and levels - but way too small. Make this the size limit, and you have a contender. You have a good eye, don''t sell us short!</td>', 'Nice comp, scenery and levels - but way too small. Make this the size limit, and you have a contender. You have a good eye, don''t sell us short!', '2008-03-22 03:53:59.000000', NULL, 1),
