(4579709, 658460, 90394, '<td valign="top">A barb of wire does not a fence make. I don''t think these are in the spirit of the challenge, but I like the web-strands on top, and bottom. Composed efficiently too, but this is a shoehorn, at best.</td>', 'A barb of wire does not a fence make. I don''t think these are in the spirit of the challenge, but I like the web-strands on top, and bottom. Composed efficiently too, but this is a shoehorn, at best.', '2008-03-22 05:58:24.000000', NULL, 1),
