(4579714, 658484, 90394, '<td valign="top">Wow... excellent scenery, well composed and good levels, but this is oversharpened. This would have scored higher if not so. I really wanted to give this a big score, but that granular "oversharp" effect hurts just a tad.</td>', 'Wow... excellent scenery, well composed and good levels, but this is oversharpened. This would have scored higher if not so. I really wanted to give this a big score, but that granular "oversharp" effect hurts just a tad.', '2008-03-22 06:03:35.000000', NULL, 1),
