(4579717, 658755, 90394, '<td valign="top">The oversharpness hurts an otherwise fantastic scene, along with a bit of overexposure - I might have given this a ten, if not for those two elements. Expertly composed, as well. You do notice how the "unsharp mask" made those "halos" aropund the trees, right? Don''t worry about the sharpness freaks!!!! Oftentimes, a more natural appearance is preferable, and would have really helped here...</td>', 'The oversharpness hurts an otherwise fantastic scene, along with a bit of overexposure - I might have given this a ten, if not for those two elements. Expertly composed, as well. You do notice how the "unsharp mask" made those "halos" aropund the trees, right? Don''t worry about the sharpness freaks!!!! Oftentimes, a more natural appearance is preferable, and would have really helped here...', '2008-03-22 06:08:59.000000', NULL, 1),
