(4583004, 658110, 67697, '<td valign="top">This is cool and a great find.  It will probably make me think twice before touching any fences lol.  Great capture of it''s face too - it does look like he OWNS the fence.</td>', 'This is cool and a great find.  It will probably make me think twice before touching any fences lol.  Great capture of it''s face too - it does look like he OWNS the fence.', '2008-03-24 10:03:26.000000', NULL, 1),
(4583009, 659272, 67697, '<td valign="top">I like the layout of this photo.  The windmill in the background is a really interesting touch.  Beautiful sky, but a little red sunspot above the barb.  Lol what can you do when you are pointing your camera right at the sun?  Pretty photo.</td>', 'I like the layout of this photo.  The windmill in the background is a really interesting touch.  Beautiful sky, but a little red sunspot above the barb.  Lol what can you do when you are pointing your camera right at the sun?  Pretty photo.', '2008-03-24 10:04:53.000000', NULL, 1),
(4583014, 659066, 67697, '<td valign="top">I really like this closeup shot.  I am surprised that they get this close to the barbed fence.  I love seeing the big nose.  The border is a great complement to the wire but it created this brighter line running along them.  Not sure what causes that.  Cute photo!</td>', 'I really like this closeup shot.  I am surprised that they get this close to the barbed fence.  I love seeing the big nose.  The border is a great complement to the wire but it created this brighter line running along them.  Not sure what causes that.  Cute photo!', '2008-03-24 10:06:59.000000', NULL, 1),
(4583016, 658988, 67697, '<td valign="top">The color tone is perfect for this victorian scene.  I feel like I am looking at an old photo.  Very cool.</td>', 'The color tone is perfect for this victorian scene.  I feel like I am looking at an old photo.  Very cool.', '2008-03-24 10:07:44.000000', NULL, 1),
(4583022, 658244, 15291, '<td valign="top">Well done.</td>', 'Well done.', '2008-03-24 10:10:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4583023, 659239, 15291, '<td valign="top">Nicely done, like the person walking the beach gives the image scale.</td>', 'Nicely done, like the person walking the beach gives the image scale.', '2008-03-24 10:11:23.000000', NULL, 1),
(4583028, 657754, 15291, '<td valign="top">Very nice. A Clean, sharp image.</td>', 'Very nice. A Clean, sharp image.', '2008-03-24 10:12:50.000000', NULL, 1),
(4583031, 659145, 15291, '<td valign="top">Well done. The compostion is great.</td>', 'Well done. The compostion is great.', '2008-03-24 10:13:39.000000', NULL, 1),
(4583037, 659612, 15291, '<td valign="top">A very nice image I like the angel you took here.</td>', 'A very nice image I like the angel you took here.', '2008-03-24 10:14:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4583042, 659504, 15291, '<td valign="top">Very well done I like the use of your dof here.</td>', 'Very well done I like the use of your dof here.', '2008-03-24 10:15:40.000000', NULL, 1),
(4583080, 659341, 15291, '<td valign="top">Cool, the one thing that caught my eye here was the matchbox car &amp; it''s wheels hanging off the edge.</td>', 'Cool, the one thing that caught my eye here was the matchbox car & it''s wheels hanging off the edge.', '2008-03-24 10:24:51.000000', NULL, 1),
(4583093, 658679, 15291, '<td valign="top">Real nice image. Not sure if you intented to blur the deer &amp; fence in front or not, but in either case it hurt the image.Having those two nice an sharp would have put this on the front page (imho).</td>', 'Real nice image. Not sure if you intented to blur the deer & fence in front or not, but in either case it hurt the image.Having those two nice an sharp would have put this on the front page (imho).', '2008-03-24 10:32:00.000000', NULL, 1),
(4583094, 659682, 15291, '<td valign="top">A very nice image. The sky seems to be a little hot however.</td>', 'A very nice image. The sky seems to be a little hot however.', '2008-03-24 10:33:14.000000', NULL, 1),
(4583097, 658060, 15291, '<td valign="top">Nice image.</td>', 'Nice image.', '2008-03-24 10:34:08.000000', NULL, 1);
