(4587053, 659102, 19799, '<td valign="top">This is a good capture. Even though the fence is not intact, the setting really lends to the mood and feel of the shot.</td>', 'This is a good capture. Even though the fence is not intact, the setting really lends to the mood and feel of the shot.', '2008-03-25 23:06:39.000000', NULL, 1),
