(4587068, 659547, 19799, '<td valign="top">Having more of the fence to look at would be nice but this is a great attempt at holding the theme by placing the background OOF.</td>', 'Having more of the fence to look at would be nice but this is a great attempt at holding the theme by placing the background OOF.', '2008-03-25 23:11:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4587071, 659233, 19799, '<td valign="top">Good attempt at holding the fence theme by having the fence in sharp focus and the background OOF. Maybe boost contrast a bit as the shoot seems a bit flat.</td>', 'Good attempt at holding the fence theme by having the fence in sharp focus and the background OOF. Maybe boost contrast a bit as the shoot seems a bit flat.', '2008-03-25 23:12:32.000000', NULL, 1),
(4587072, 659454, 19799, '<td valign="top">Definitely without the fence the graffiti isn''t available. This image seems to have the graffiti as the main point. I do like how the two kiddos walking have colours that complement the graffiti artwork.</td>', 'Definitely without the fence the graffiti isn''t available. This image seems to have the graffiti as the main point. I do like how the two kiddos walking have colours that complement the graffiti artwork.', '2008-03-25 23:14:19.000000', NULL, 1),
(4587075, 659504, 19799, '<td valign="top">A great example of how simplicity can be a wonderful thing. The thing that makes the photo pop are the sharp focus on the fence, the colour of the fence and the red background, and the fact that the background is OOF. Nice capture!</td>', 'A great example of how simplicity can be a wonderful thing. The thing that makes the photo pop are the sharp focus on the fence, the colour of the fence and the red background, and the fact that the background is OOF. Nice capture!', '2008-03-25 23:15:36.000000', NULL, 1),
(4587081, 659396, 19799, '<td valign="top">I can''t put my finger on it but somehow this works for me. Maybe it''s because of the vastness and gigantic size of the mountains are in start contrast to the flimsy and limited fence. The diagonal line of the fence does a great job of separating the foreground elements and background elements too.</td>', 'I can''t put my finger on it but somehow this works for me. Maybe it''s because of the vastness and gigantic size of the mountains are in start contrast to the flimsy and limited fence. The diagonal line of the fence does a great job of separating the foreground elements and background elements too.', '2008-03-25 23:17:30.000000', NULL, 1),
(4587082, 658346, 19799, '<td valign="top">The fence seems to be an innocent bystander in this shot. A really good capture using converging lines though.</td>', 'The fence seems to be an innocent bystander in this shot. A really good capture using converging lines though.', '2008-03-25 23:18:18.000000', NULL, 1),
(4587085, 659479, 19799, '<td valign="top">If I didn''t know I was in the Fence contest I wouldn''t have a clue what I was looking at. Very abstract...good...but makes it hard to see how it in the context of a fence theme.</td>', 'If I didn''t know I was in the Fence contest I wouldn''t have a clue what I was looking at. Very abstract...good...but makes it hard to see how it in the context of a fence theme.', '2008-03-25 23:19:47.000000', NULL, 1),
(4587089, 659116, 19799, '<td valign="top">Having the fence as the only diagonal line in the shot helps. For me, the shot still has the foliage as the focus points though.</td>', 'Having the fence as the only diagonal line in the shot helps. For me, the shot still has the foliage as the focus points though.', '2008-03-25 23:20:49.000000', NULL, 1),
