(4587102, 657785, 19799, '<td valign="top">The fence in this shot does do a good job of holding the eye to the man and the seats. Because of the lighting I see the focal point of the shot being the man and much less about the fence. Good colour and framework.</td>', 'The fence in this shot does do a good job of holding the eye to the man and the seats. Because of the lighting I see the focal point of the shot being the man and much less about the fence. Good colour and framework.', '2008-03-25 23:24:42.000000', NULL, 1),
