(4587132, 658646, 19799, '<td valign="top">This is a nice candid portrait shot that uses the lines of the fence to draw you to her face. The only thing I would add is careful of your backgrounds...the green door on the right is a bit distracting to the flow of the photo.</td>', 'This is a nice candid portrait shot that uses the lines of the fence to draw you to her face. The only thing I would add is careful of your backgrounds...the green door on the right is a bit distracting to the flow of the photo.', '2008-03-25 23:36:42.000000', NULL, 1),
