(4587224, 658984, 67697, '<td valign="top">Oh my, this is definitely not a sub-5 shot.  I gave it a 6 (which probably doesn''t sound all that impressive lol) only because I wanted the fence appearance to be a little stronger.  The spots on the leopard dominate the whole photo.  However, those spots and the leopard are beautifully processed and this is a gorgeous black and white piece.</td>', 'Oh my, this is definitely not a sub-5 shot.  I gave it a 6 (which probably doesn''t sound all that impressive lol) only because I wanted the fence appearance to be a little stronger.  The spots on the leopard dominate the whole photo.  However, those spots and the leopard are beautifully processed and this is a gorgeous black and white piece.', '2008-03-26 00:11:16.000000', NULL, 0),
