(4587332, 659202, 66635, '<td valign="top">To any of you who didn''t figure this out on your own, this photo was intended to be submitted to the Environmental Portrait challenge.  I submitted it to fences by mistake.  When the SC wouldn''t let me switch it over, I decided that at could at least set my sights on the brown ribbon.  How the heck did I lose?  Damn!</td>', 'To any of you who didn''t figure this out on your own, this photo was intended to be submitted to the Environmental Portrait challenge.  I submitted it to fences by mistake.  When the SC wouldn''t let me switch it over, I decided that at could at least set my sights on the brown ribbon.  How the heck did I lose?  Damn!', '2008-03-26 00:28:47.000000', NULL, 0),
