(4587788, 659140, 34462, '<td valign="top">Well done Jon. As a garden person and part time bird watcher I am envious when I see such a wonderful shot of the flitty little guys. I like the green as it adds contrast to the bird. My guess is that folks didn''t see the fence. Maybe you have have called it straddling the fence.</td>', 'Well done Jon. As a garden person and part time bird watcher I am envious when I see such a wonderful shot of the flitty little guys. I like the green as it adds contrast to the bird. My guess is that folks didn''t see the fence. Maybe you have have called it straddling the fence.', '2008-03-26 07:12:46.000000', NULL, 0),
(4587791, 659611, 55005, '<td valign="top">Well done, Nick!  Congrats on top 25!</td>', 'Well done, Nick!  Congrats on top 25!', '2008-03-26 07:14:31.000000', NULL, 0),
