(4587867, 659530, 24454, '<td valign="top">Woo Hooo Charmayne!!!!  This is so awesome!   You chose the right one.   The fence is just so interesting and artistic -- but the combination of the dramatic sky and light -- this one could NOT be beat!  Congratulations on 1st prize!<br/> <br/></td>', 'Woo Hooo Charmayne!!!!  This is so awesome!   You chose the right one.   The fence is just so interesting and artistic -- but the combination of the dramatic sky and light -- this one could NOT be beat!  Congratulations on 1st prize! ', '2008-03-26 07:59:03.000000', NULL, 0),
(4587868, 658984, 80458, '<td valign="top">i feel like a jerk. I went back and saw the fence this time around after giving you a low score. You were probably like wtf is wrong with this guy.<br/> <br/>Anyways - I like the photo - and the loose interpretation on the theme, but I think the fence is too abstract still. If it werent for a fence competition, I''d have rated it probably as an 8.<br/> <br/></td>', 'i feel like a jerk. I went back and saw the fence this time around after giving you a low score. You were probably like wtf is wrong with this guy. Anyways - I like the photo - and the loose interpretation on the theme, but I think the fence is too abstract still. If it werent for a fence competition, I''d have rated it probably as an 8. ', '2008-03-26 07:59:26.000000', NULL, 0),
