(4588383, 659609, 80268, '<td valign="top">Wow, thank you everyone! I can''t believe I got a ribbon...it''s such a big jump from my previous entries. I just happened to take this photo not even knowing there was a fence challenge going on, so I was a bit lucky. Of course, everything is so beautiful in Utah, it''s hard to NOT take a good photo!<br/> <br/>Thanks again...oh, and horray for my compact camera ;P<br/> <br/>Edit: Um...not sure how I edit my official Photographer''s comments... I am n00bly.<br/><br/><i>Message edited by author 2008-03-26 10:00:16.</i></td>', 'Wow, thank you everyone! I can''t believe I got a ribbon...it''s such a big jump from my previous entries. I just happened to take this photo not even knowing there was a fence challenge going on, so I was a bit lucky. Of course, everything is so beautiful in Utah, it''s hard to NOT take a good photo! Thanks again...oh, and horray for my compact camera ;P Edit: Um...not sure how I edit my official Photographer''s comments... I am n00bly.', '2008-03-26 09:59:06.000000', '2008-03-26 10:00:16.000000', 0),
