(4589681, 659341, 66384, '<td valign="top">This is so amazing. It took me a long time to understand it. I thought it might be an accident that you stumbled upon. Eventually I say that it was an extreme closeup of a post and rail fence. Did you place a toy car there, or was that a real car done with some sort of weird perspective? Anyway I think it is very cool, and creative, and I like the b&amp;w.</td>', 'This is so amazing. It took me a long time to understand it. I thought it might be an accident that you stumbled upon. Eventually I say that it was an extreme closeup of a post and rail fence. Did you place a toy car there, or was that a real car done with some sort of weird perspective? Anyway I think it is very cool, and creative, and I like the b&w.', '2008-03-26 17:38:02.000000', NULL, 0),
