(4589963, 658672, 88676, '<td valign="top"><table align="center" width="95%"><tr><td><div class="textsm"><b>Originally posted by johnmcboston:</b></div><hr/><i> bummer - real nice photo.   Still not sure what the rule violation though (the message is too cryptic). </i></td></tr></table> <br/> <br/>used highpass sharpen<br/> <br/>my pollution entry got dq''d for it, then I told them that I used it in this one as well, they decided to dq it too<br/> <br/>as for highpass sharpen, it was explained to me this way<br/> <br/>"The high-pass sharpen function uses a mask, which makes it selective. In addition, the "hard light" blend mode is a way of blending the result back with the original image, and changing blend modes isn''t allowed in Basic."</td>', 'Originally posted by johnmcboston: bummer - real nice photo.   Still not sure what the rule violation though (the message is too cryptic).   used highpass sharpen my pollution entry got dq''d for it, then I told them that I used it in this one as well, they decided to dq it too as for highpass sharpen, it was explained to me this way "The high-pass sharpen function uses a mask, which makes it selective. In addition, the "hard light" blend mode is a way of blending the result back with the original image, and changing blend modes isn''t allowed in Basic."', '2008-03-26 20:52:05.000000', NULL, 0),
(4589990, 658694, 24454, '<td valign="top">I am so sorry this got hammered like it so undeservingly did!  I love the capture of that tiger''s eyes, and the bokeh fence says it all!<br/> <br/>One thing I''ve learned about these dpc voters:  If you are not IN-YOUR-FACE on a no-mistake-about-what-the-subject-is topic, you WILL pay!  I think its sad.  And I think it ends up creating too many contrived boring images, but it''s been a nerve that has gotten no relief in the almost 4 years I''ve been a member.  Sigh.   I''m sorry your tiger is the latest casualty :(</td>', 'I am so sorry this got hammered like it so undeservingly did!  I love the capture of that tiger''s eyes, and the bokeh fence says it all! One thing I''ve learned about these dpc voters:  If you are not IN-YOUR-FACE on a no-mistake-about-what-the-subject-is topic, you WILL pay!  I think its sad.  And I think it ends up creating too many contrived boring images, but it''s been a nerve that has gotten no relief in the almost 4 years I''ve been a member.  Sigh.   I''m sorry your tiger is the latest casualty :(', '2008-03-26 21:17:17.000000', NULL, 0),
