(4593705, 659342, 30982, '<td valign="top">This is a good take on a flower shot.  I suspect there were voters who didn''t see this as a fence so much as a screen.  Lots of folks are being very literal in challenge voting these days.  I''m sure our Timfy will give you pointers on how to hit the voters over the head with "meets the challenge."  He tries with me, but it never takes very well.  :-)</td>', 'This is a good take on a flower shot.  I suspect there were voters who didn''t see this as a fence so much as a screen.  Lots of folks are being very literal in challenge voting these days.  I''m sure our Timfy will give you pointers on how to hit the voters over the head with "meets the challenge."  He tries with me, but it never takes very well.  :-)', '2008-03-28 12:58:49.000000', NULL, 0),
(4593717, 659648, 30982, '<td valign="top">A nice shot of as you say a "classic" - the white picket fence.  I do think these are lovely and the plants around it support it well.  A very slight crop off the top to remove the house might give this a touch more strength.</td>', 'A nice shot of as you say a "classic" - the white picket fence.  I do think these are lovely and the plants around it support it well.  A very slight crop off the top to remove the house might give this a touch more strength.', '2008-03-28 13:07:34.000000', NULL, 0),
(4593829, 658679, 30982, '<td valign="top">An excellent arrangement of your subjects - I''m sure that took a bit of time to get them "just so".  :-)  Great catch!</td>', 'An excellent arrangement of your subjects - I''m sure that took a bit of time to get them "just so".  :-)  Great catch!', '2008-03-28 14:10:22.000000', NULL, 0),
