(4594492, 658984, 48697, '<td valign="top">Wicked shot Andi! Defintly didn''t deserve the score it got though a lot of people have never shot through a fence before so they don''t recongnize the pattern.  This works great in b&amp;w and I love the two meaning title, works perfect. I didn''t vote in this challenge but I would have probably gave it a 7, higher had it been a freestudy shot. What a beautiful cat in motion, well done!</td>', 'Wicked shot Andi! Defintly didn''t deserve the score it got though a lot of people have never shot through a fence before so they don''t recongnize the pattern.  This works great in b&w and I love the two meaning title, works perfect. I didn''t vote in this challenge but I would have probably gave it a 7, higher had it been a freestudy shot. What a beautiful cat in motion, well done!', '2008-03-28 20:37:52.000000', NULL, 0),
