(4615161, 659341, 68035, '<td valign="top">Cool cool cool shot and one of my absolute favourites in the challenge.<br/> <br/>I love the fact that when you first see the image it really does look like you have captured a car framed through a hole in a fence and it is only when you look at it more closely you realise it is a toy<br/> <br/>Brillant sharpness and great bokeh in one, lovely black and white conversion.<br/> <br/>An image that I cant tear my eyes away from<br/> <br/>Wonderful and although you have scored higher in many challenges imo this is one of your best shots.  <br/> <br/>Added to favourites</td>', 'Cool cool cool shot and one of my absolute favourites in the challenge. I love the fact that when you first see the image it really does look like you have captured a car framed through a hole in a fence and it is only when you look at it more closely you realise it is a toy Brillant sharpness and great bokeh in one, lovely black and white conversion. An image that I cant tear my eyes away from Wonderful and although you have scored higher in many challenges imo this is one of your best shots.   Added to favourites', '2008-04-05 03:50:12.000000', NULL, 0),
(4615180, 659140, 67145, '<td valign="top">yes jon ... its a brilliant image .. i love those claws too !!.. love the sharpness of the bird .. so focused .. who knows wot those voters are thinking when they give something like this so many low votes .. probably nothing !! ..<br/>thank you for your excellent comment on my ''dancing droplets'' .. i''m glad you liked it .. more than quite a few voters .. at least you have some taste !!!! ..:) lol ..</td>', 'yes jon ... its a brilliant image .. i love those claws too !!.. love the sharpness of the bird .. so focused .. who knows wot those voters are thinking when they give something like this so many low votes .. probably nothing !! ..thank you for your excellent comment on my ''dancing droplets'' .. i''m glad you liked it .. more than quite a few voters .. at least you have some taste !!!! ..:) lol ..', '2008-04-05 04:04:28.000000', NULL, 0),
(4619479, 659333, 66524, '<td valign="top">I like how the bend of the grasses really bring you into the photo.  This is excellent composition - my eye is delighted by being walked through the photo with all the compositional devices: the grasses, slope of mountain, and the streak in the sky...delightful!</td>', 'I like how the bend of the grasses really bring you into the photo.  This is excellent composition - my eye is delighted by being walked through the photo with all the compositional devices: the grasses, slope of mountain, and the streak in the sky...delightful!', '2008-04-06 23:55:06.000000', NULL, 0),
(4626499, 659202, 67697, '<td valign="top">I did not give this one a score because I saw your note in the thread and figured this was yours.  By looking at the scores, people obviously did not figure it out.  Too bad you did put it in the wrong challenge because I thought it was really good for the portrait challenge.  I love how you caught him while banging the drum and it''s also cool that he is looking at you too.</td>', 'I did not give this one a score because I saw your note in the thread and figured this was yours.  By looking at the scores, people obviously did not figure it out.  Too bad you did put it in the wrong challenge because I thought it was really good for the portrait challenge.  I love how you caught him while banging the drum and it''s also cool that he is looking at you too.', '2008-04-09 10:31:33.000000', NULL, 0),
